## After the fight

@aria{emotion="surprised"}: Did we win? We won! Those were Hollow hounds. They eat light.
@lumi: They'll be back. The Hollow King sends them wherever a star falls.
@aria: Then we don't let them catch any more. Where's the next star?
@lumi: East. Toward the keep. Of course it's toward the keep.
